+            C * k ^ 2 * ∫ z in Ω, ‖herglotzCoeff k a 1 z‖ ^ 2 ∧
+          (∫ z in Ω, ‖herglotzCoeff k a (-1) z‖ ^ 2) + ∫ z in Ω, ‖herglotzCoeff k a (-2) z‖ ^ 2 ≤
+            C * k ^ 4 * ∫ z in Ω, ‖herglotzCoeff k a 1 z‖ ^ 2 := by
