-      ((∫ z in Ω, h1Gradient Ω 1 u z * φ z) +
-        ∫ z in Ω, h1Value Ω u z * dirD φ Complex.I z) =
-      ∫ θ in Ioc (0 : ℝ) (2 * π), h1BoundaryTrace hb hL hγ u θ *
-        (φ (γ θ) * deriv γ θ) := by
