-regularity proves half-order regularity of the full normalized input. -/
-theorem roughNormalizedLoad_half_of_primitive_pos_one (y : L2Z)
-    (hfin : (Function.support (((1 - posProj) y : L2Z) : ℤ → ℂ)).Finite)
